invariant: INV-7
file: handshake_flight.c
catches: webpki_session_test
reason: require_pq no longer refuses a ServerHello that selects x25519. The
  webpki parser accepts both groups, because the hello normally shares
  both, so this compare is the only thing that holds a require_pq caller
  to the hybrid: without it a server moves that caller to a classic
  exchange the hello never offered, and the handshake completes.

--- old
    if (h->t->cfg.require_pq && h->t->group != CH_GROUP_X25519MLKEM768) {
--- new
    if (0) {
